  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Logic: **Third no. = **[(First no. + Second no.) × 7]**\n\n**Given:**\n\n**(9, 14, 161) →**\n\n​⇒ [(9 + 14) × 7]\n\n​⇒ (23 × 7) = 161\n\n**(12, 18, 210) →**\n\n​⇒ [(12 + 18) × 7]\n\n​⇒ (30 × 7) = 210\n\nChecking the given options:\n\n**1.** (23, 40, 371) →\n\n​⇒ [(23 + 40) × 7]\n\n​⇒ (63 × 7) = 441\n\n**2.** (40, 20, 340) →\n\n​⇒ [(40 + 20) × 7]\n\n​⇒ (60 × 7) = 420\n\n**3.** (11, 33, 348) →\n\n​⇒ [(11 + 33) × 7]\n\n​⇒ (44 × 7) = 305\n\n**4. **(29, 17, 322) →\n\n​⇒ [(29 + 17) × 7]\n\n​⇒ (46 × 7) = **322**\n\nHere, **(29, 17, 322)** is similar to the given sets of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (4)\".\n\n7b:Tdc3,\n<p style=&",
